// Jump to a message older than the newest 200 (a window around it), then
// the jump button (Command-Down): the newest, with no reload flash (review
// table row 4: "a reload when you press the jump button"; rule 4: the
// window reaching the newest is apart from being at the bottom).
// check: jump land=target
